        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "A roof replacement in Utah in 2026 typically costs between $8,000 and $25,000, with most homeowners paying around $10,000 to $16,000 for a standard 2,000-square-foot asphalt shingle roof. Pricing averages about $3.50 to $8.00 per square foot depending on the material, pitch, and complexity of the home.",
